---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Angkor Self-Guided Tour Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Angkor Self-Guided Tour by Kroma Digital.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">App Privacy</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy — Angkor Self-Guided Tour</h1>
      <p>Privacy information for the Angkor Self-Guided Tour Android application.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p><strong>Effective date: September 21, 2026</strong><br />
      <strong>Developer: Kroma Digital</strong><br />
      <strong>Application ID: <code>com.kromadigital.angkortour</code></strong></p>

      <p>Angkor Self-Guided Tour is a self-guided travel application designed to help visitors explore Angkor temples using location-based walking guidance.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>Angkor Self-Guided Tour does not require users to create an account.</p>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not collect or store personal information such as:</p>
      <ul><li>Name</li><li>Email address</li><li>Phone number</li><li>Contacts</li><li>Photos or videos</li><li>Messages</li></ul>
      <p>The app uses device location as described below.</p>

      <h2>2. Location Information</h2>
      <p>Angkor Self-Guided Tour uses your device's location, including precise location, to provide GPS-based tour guidance.</p>
      <p>Location access is used for features such as:</p>
      <ul><li>Determining your current position during a tour</li><li>Calculating the distance to the next tour stop</li><li>Detecting when you arrive near a tour stop</li><li>Providing location-based walking guidance</li></ul>
      <p>The app may request approximate location and precise location.</p>
      <p>Location information used for tour navigation is processed on your device.</p>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not transmit your GPS location to Kroma Digital servers and does not sell or share your location information with advertisers or other third parties.</p>
      <p>You can control location permission at any time through your device's Android settings. Some tour guidance features may not function correctly if location access is disabled.</p>

      <h2>3. Purchase Information</h2>
      <p>Angkor Self-Guided Tour may offer a one-time purchase through Google Play.</p>
      <p>Payments are processed by Google Play and are subject to Google's own privacy policy and payment terms.</p>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not directly receive or store your credit card number, bank account information, or full payment credentials.</p>
      <p>The app may receive purchase status information from Google Play when necessary to determine whether paid content or features have been unlocked.</p>

      <h2>4. Information Stored on Your Device</h2>
      <p>The app may store information locally on your device, including:</p>
      <ul><li>Language settings</li><li>Tour progress</li><li>Visited tour stops</li><li>Purchase or unlock status where applicable</li><li>Other settings required for the operation of the app</li></ul>
      <p>This information is used to provide app functionality.</p>

      <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>The app may use Google services required for Android functionality, including:</p>
      <ul><li>Google Play services for device location functionality</li><li>Google Play Billing for processing purchases</li></ul>
      <p>These services may process information according to their own privacy policies.</p>
      <p>Google Privacy Policy: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a></p>
      <p>Google Play Terms of Service: <a href="https://play.google.com/about/play-terms/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://play.google.com/about/play-terms/</a></p>

      <h2>6. Advertising and Analytics</h2>
      <p>Angkor Self-Guided Tour does not display third-party advertising.</p>
      <p>The current version does not use third-party advertising SDKs.</p>
      <p>Unless explicitly added in a future version, the app does not use third-party analytics services to track users for advertising or marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2>7. Data Sharing and Sale</h2>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not sell users' personal information.</p>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not sell GPS location information.</p>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not share GPS location information with advertisers.</p>
      <p>Information may be processed by service providers such as Google when required to provide Google Play, billing, or device location functionality, subject to their respective privacy policies.</p>

      <h2>8. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Tour progress and app settings may be stored locally on the user's device.</p>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not maintain a server-side history of users' GPS movements through this app.</p>
      <p>Locally stored information may be removed when the app is uninstalled or when the application's data is cleared, subject to Android backup and device behavior.</p>

      <h2>9. Permissions</h2>
      <p>The app may request the following Android permissions:</p>
      <ul><li>Approximate location</li><li>Precise location</li></ul>
      <p>These permissions are used to provide location-based tour functionality.</p>
      <p>The app does not use location information for advertising.</p>

      <h2>10. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Angkor Self-Guided Tour is a general travel application and is not specifically directed at children.</p>
      <p>Kroma Digital does not knowingly collect personal information from children through the app.</p>

      <h2>11. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>This Privacy Policy may be updated when the app's features, third-party services, or legal requirements change.</p>
      <p>Any updated version will be published on this page with a revised effective date.</p>

      <h2>12. Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact Kroma Digital through the <a href="/contact">Kroma Digital Contact page</a>.</p>
      <p>Website: <a href="https://kroma-digital.pages.dev/">https://kroma-digital.pages.dev/</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
